#nexus

[36 mitochondrial haplotypes of the dusky dolphin (Lagenorhynchus obscurus) over their 60 variable sites,
 Cassens et al. 2003, Molecular Ecology 12:1781-1792, as distributed with SplitsTree.]

BEGIN Taxa;
DIMENSIONS ntax=36;
TAXLABELS
